{
 "_about": [
  "THE sensor life of a source that doesn't say all of it (docs/44 decision 10; sources.json 'life' and 'wear'):",
  "what the card's warm-up and time left, Sensor ended (no data quiet), the sensor reminders, the countdown and the",
  "calendar use. Inputs: the source ('life' from sources.json), whose glucose ('person'), the sensor the source said",
  "('said': its id and start, null = none), the source's wear length setting ('wearMin', minutes; 0 or less = the",
  "default, contracts/sensor/life.json defaultWearMin), the manual start (schema sensor.manualStart, null = none) and",
  "the newest reading ('latest', null = none). Times relative to 'now' (s). Rule: the source's start counts unless it",
  "is ahead of now; a manual start counts only for life 'maybeStart' / 'none', your glucose, and not ahead of now;",
  "the newer of the two wins, the source's on a tie ('from'). id = the source's, or 'manual-<start epoch s>' (a new",
  "manual start is a new sensor). warmupEnd = start + defaultWarmupMin, end = start + the wear length. 'state' =",
  "warming / active / ended by life.json's rule. expect null = life unknown (no reminders, no countdown, never Sensor",
  "ended). A source or person change clears the manual start (each app's source store, not here). Run by",
  "SensorLivesContractTest (Android :core:model) and SensorLivesTests (Mac CoreTests)."
 ],
